<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>VPN</title>
<style>
:root{box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
body{background:#fff;color:#fff;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;transition:background .6s}
body.dark{background:#000}
.screen{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;padding:24px;text-align:center}
#load{transition:opacity .6s}
#load.off{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.sq{width:min(34vw,170px);aspect-ratio:1;background:#ff3d00;border-radius:22%;animation:p 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes p{50%{transform:scale(.96)}}
#main,#end{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .6s}
#main.on,#end.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
p{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;max-width:22em}
button{font:inherit;font-size:14px;background:#fff;color:#000;border:0;border-radius:4px;padding:11px 24px;cursor:pointer}
button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ff3d00;outline-offset:3px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.sq{animation:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="screen" id="load"><div class="sq"></div></div>
<div class="screen" id="main">
  <p>Чтобы подключить впн нужно сначала дать мне 67 биткоинов 😊</p>
  <button id="btn" type="button">подключить</button>
</div>
<div class="screen" id="end"><p>МЕДАГОВ ЛОХ !!</p></div>
<audio id="snd" preload="auto" src="data:audio/mpeg;base64,"></audio>
<script>
var $=function(i){return document.getElementById(i)};
setTimeout(function(){
  document.body.classList.add("dark");
  $("load").classList.add("off");
  $("main").classList.add("on");
},3000);
$("btn").addEventListener("click",function(){
  try{var s=$("snd");s.currentTime=0;var r=s.play();if(r&&r.catch)r.catch(function(){})}catch(e){}
  $("main").classList.remove("on");
  $("end").classList.add("on");
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
